WEBVTT

00:00:27.985 --> 00:00:31.754
he thought I meant organizing,
like, Marie Kondo-style.

00:00:31.778 --> 00:00:32.796
(Laughter)

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:36.476
He was like, "Oh, that's so great,
I could use some of that around here.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.757
I would love to clean up
our patient files."

00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:42.934
And I had to explain to him that no, no,
it's not that kind of organizing,

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.500
it's more like if you showed up
to work tomorrow

00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:48.023
and all the nurses in the office
had gotten together

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.856
to ask for an across-the-board raise.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.021
(Laughter)

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:54.761
"Oh," he replied, and he got really quiet.

00:00:54.785 --> 00:00:55.771
(Laughter)

00:00:55.795 --> 00:00:58.577
Yeah, and that's
the second kind of reaction:

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:00.188
the uncomfortable kind.